{
  "description": "The module-requirement cases (templates.md §8; C06). Pure input→output cases for the packet-72 resolver: the finite registry, the declared vs content-derived rules, the fail-fast validation, and the evaluation points. The checker re-derives each output from the §8.2 rules.",
